[Infobox Text]
Welcome to I.K.E.M.E.N GO engine! (%s - %s)

* This is a public development release, for testing purposes.
* This build may contain bugs and incomplete features.
* Your help and cooperation are appreciated!
* Source code: https://github.com/ikemen-engine/Ikemen-GO
* Bug reports: https://github.com/ikemen-engine/Ikemen-GO/issues
* Docs: https://github.com/ikemen-engine/Ikemen-GO/wiki

